* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VP VB1 VB3 VREF VB2 VB5 VB4 VS5 VS1 VS2 VIN VS4 VS3
.model DIODE D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
